        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we currently provide TerraPoiNT services to customers, going forward, we anticipate transitioning to our NextGen solution when it becomes commercially ready, which is intended in part to leverage legacy TerraPoiNT’s technology and service delivery platform and adapt it to 5G.",
        "start_character": 8551,
        "end_character": 8836
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001554855-26-000328",
